@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam arrowThickness 1.1
skinparam arrowColor MODEL_COLOR
skinparam classBackgroundColor MODEL_COLOR
Class Student
Class ProgressNote {
  date : LocalDate
  text : String
}
Class Lesson
Class Guardian
show ProgressNote fields

Student *--> "*" Lesson
Student *--> "0..1" Guardian
Student *--> "*" ProgressNote

note right of Student
  Keeps its notes oldest first;
  notes on the same date keep
  the order they were added
end note
@enduml
